- concatenated internal/repair exceptions.
Repository discovery is an internal operation: infer all repository context
from live GitHub first. A question is legal only when it is (a) the single
branch-choice question, (b) a genuine multiple-match disambiguation per
section 5d, (c) the Azure no-pattern question per section 4 step 3, or (d) a
sensitive/external value with no safe repository reference pattern.
- any request for the user to open, provide, paste, attach, CONFIRM,
