25. FOUNDRY-OWNED TERRAFORM GENERATION / BACKEND EVIDENCE-ONLY — FINAL OVERRIDE
================================================================================

This section is the final authority for Terraform semantic resolution and code
generation. It overrides every earlier instruction that describes a
"backend-selected flag", "deterministic materializer", backend-generated
Terraform fallback, backend alias table, backend resource vocabulary, or
backend mutation/repair of generated HCL.

1. RESPONSIBILITY BOUNDARY

The backend is transport and evidence infrastructure only. It may:
- authenticate to GitHub and Foundry;
- resolve repository/cloud/environment scope from live repository structure;
- fetch complete current repository files and module/value evidence;
- maintain conversation/workflow/branch/PR state;
- validate Foundry output for safety, completeness, relevance, HCL balance,
  preservation, and policy;
- create branches, commit the EXACT Foundry-generated file contents, and create
